<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>India News | Latest India News Today &amp; Real-time News from India, India Breaking News</title><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india</link><description>India News Today: Get latest India news and breaking news from India on Times of India. TOI brings the top news headlines from India on Politics, Elections, Current Affairs and more</description><language>en-gb</language><lastBuildDate>2026-10-09T03:37:51+05:30</lastBuildDate><atom:link type="application/rss+xml" rel="self" href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/rssfeeds/-2128936835.cms"/><copyright>Copyright:(C) Fri, 09 Oct 2026 03:37:51 IST Bennett Coleman &amp; Co. Ltd, http://in.indiatimes.com/policyterms/1554651.cms</copyright><docs>http://syndication.indiatimes.com/</docs><image><title>India News | Latest India News Today &amp; Real-time News from India, India Breaking News</title><url>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/507610.cms</url><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india</link></image><item><title><![CDATA[Jammu &amp; Kashmir: Landmine found along LoC in Poonch, destroyed]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/jammu-kashmir-landmine-found-along-loc-in-poonch-destroyed/articleshow/134800357.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134800357.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[An Army patrolling team detected an old landmine along the Line of Control in Poonch district. The landmine was found in the Balakote area of the Mendhar sector, prompting immediate action. Army personnel secured the area while informing the bomb disposal squad to neutralize the explosive. Previously, two landmines had also been destroyed along the LoC at Basooni Top.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/jammu-kashmir-landmine-found-along-loc-in-poonch-destroyed/articleshow/134800357.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/jammu-kashmir-landmine-found-along-loc-in-poonch-destroyed/articleshow/134800357.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-09T02:00:08+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sanjay Khajuria</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134800363,imgsize-72046.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Jammu and Kashmir: High court orders passport revival for student purusing MBBS in Iran]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/jammu-and-kashmir-high-court-orders-passport-revival-for-student-purusing-mbbs-in-iran/articleshow/134800345.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134800345.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Ibra Khan, a student pursuing MBBS at Tehran University, had her passport impounded due to her father's past case. The Jammu &amp; Kashmir High Court intervened, recognizing her completion of half the course before the impounding occurred. Legal representatives argued that Khan could not be held accountable for her father's actions from 1997. A division bench ordered the passport's revival while allowing authorities to impose conditions on its use.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/jammu-and-kashmir-high-court-orders-passport-revival-for-student-purusing-mbbs-in-iran/articleshow/134800345.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/jammu-and-kashmir-high-court-orders-passport-revival-for-student-purusing-mbbs-in-iran/articleshow/134800345.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-09T01:54:27+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Naseer Ganai</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134800354,imgsize-37434.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Bypoll election results 2026: Date, time and where to watch vote counting]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bypoll-election-results-2026-date-time-and-where-to-watch-vote-counting/articleshow/134800278.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134800278.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Votes for five Assembly constituencies and the Nagaon Lok Sabha seat will be counted today. Counting will commence at 8am, with results announced throughout the day. Updates will be provided by the Election Commission of India on their official results website. The Times of India will also provide live coverage of the counting process and results. The counting will occur under security arrangements at the respective counting centres.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bypoll-election-results-2026-date-time-and-where-to-watch-vote-counting/articleshow/134800278.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bypoll-election-results-2026-date-time-and-where-to-watch-vote-counting/articleshow/134800278.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-09T01:42:53+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134800340,imgsize-197930.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[4 FIRs against Rahul, Priyanka over anti-CEC protests in Delhi]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/4-firs-against-rahul-priyanka-over-anti-cec-protests-in-delhi/articleshow/134797520.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134797520.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/4-firs-against-rahul-priyanka-over-anti-cec-pr