.indiatimes.com/photo/134793524.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The bypolls were held on Tuesday, October 6, in Nandigram and Rejinagar in West Bengal, Madurantakam and Dharapuram in Tamil Nadu, Nagaon in Assam and Thattanchavady in Puducherry. Counting of votes in all six constituencies is scheduled for Friday, with the process beginning at 8 am. The results across these six contests, by the end of the day, would  provide more than individual winners and losers.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bengal-tamil-nadu-assam-and-puducherry-brace-for-closely-watched-bypoll-verdicts/articleshow/134793524.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bengal-tamil-nadu-assam-and-puducherry-brace-for-closely-watched-bypoll-verdicts/articleshow/134793524.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-08T21:21:46+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rajeev Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134794790,imgsize-231846.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[India to come out with a national plan to boost small-scale fisheries sector]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-to-come-out-with-a-national-plan-to-boost-small-scale-fisheries-sector/articleshow/134794725.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134794725.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-to-come-out-with-a-national-plan-to-boost-small-scale-fisheries-sector/articleshow/134794725.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-to-come-out-with-a-national-plan-to-boost-small-scale-fisheries-sector/articleshow/134794725.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-08T21:20:01+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vishwa Mohan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134794788,imgsize-87558.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Govt proposes prior approval for ads of Schedule H, H1 and X drugs]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/govt-proposes-prior-approval-for-ads-of-schedule-h-h1-and-x-drugs/articleshow/134794693.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134794693.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/govt-proposes-prior-approval-for-ads-of-schedule-h-h1-and-x-drugs/articleshow/134794693.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/govt-proposes-prior-approval-for-ads-of-schedule-h-h1-and-x-drugs/articleshow/134794693.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-08T21:16:04+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134794816,imgsize-95370.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Welcome to India': Rahul Gandhi reacts to Musk's remarks; Starlink boss says 'thank you']]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/welcome-to-india-elon-rahul-gandhi-responds-to-musks-starlink-remarks/articleshow/134794474.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134794474.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Rahul Gandhi has weighed in on Elon Musk's comments about the hold-up of Starlink's commercial operations in India. Musk voiced his exasperation over regulatory obstacles, suggesting that oligarchs sway the industry. The government swiftly countered, emphasising the fairness of its regulations among satellite operators and underlining the importance of security compliance for safeguarding users and data alike.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/welcome-to-india-elon-rahul-gandhi-responds-to-musks-starlink-remarks/articleshow/134794474.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/welcome-to-india-elon-rahul-gandhi-responds-to-musks-starlink-remarks/articleshow/134794474.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-08T21:01:30+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pallavi</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134794511,imgsize-31048.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[INDIA bloc protests against CEC: 'Unite to fight' proposes Uddhav's Sena; will AAP, DMK relent?]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-block-protests-against-cec-unite-to-fight-proposes-uddhavs-sena-will-aap-dmk-relent/articleshow/134793601.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134793601.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Uddhav Thackeray's Shiv Sena has called on AAP and DMK to join opposition forces against CEC Gyanesh Kumar over irregularities in SIR. Despite AAP's separation from the INDIA bloc and DMK's mixed reactions, the lack of participation from both factions underscores existing rifts in the opposition landscape. Analysts argue that these parties might still rally together to uphold democratic principles, though future collaboration remains clouded by their historical rivalries.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-block-protests-against-cec-unite-to-fight-proposes-uddhavs-sena-will-aap-dmk-relent/articleshow/134793601.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-block-protests-against-cec-unite-to-fight-proposes-uddhavs-sena-will-aap-dmk-relent/articleshow/134793601.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-08T20:55:49+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Kunal Varma</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134795119,imgsize-1326886.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Musk goes on rant after India rejects ‘oligarch’ claim: What makes Starlink controversial]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/musk-goes-on-rant-after-india-rejects-oligarch-claim-what-makes-starlink-controversial/articleshow/134794140.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134794140.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/musk-goes-on-rant-after-india-rejects-oligarch-claim-what-makes-starlink-controversial/articleshow/134794140.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/musk-goes-on-rant-after-india-rejects-oligarch-claim-what-makes-starlink-controversial/articleshow/134794140.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-08T20:43:39+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vivek Dubey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134794271,imgsize-114044.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Remain alert, stay indoors': India issues advisory for citizens in Saudi Arabia amid Houthi attacks]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/remain-alert-stay-indoors-india-issues-advisory-to-citizens-in-saudi-arabia-amid-houthi-attacks/articleshow/134794137.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134794137.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/remain-alert-stay-indoors-india-issues-advisory-to-citizens-in-saudi-arabia-amid-houthi-attacks/articleshow/134794137.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/remain-alert-stay-indoors-india-issues-advisory-to-citizens-in-saudi-arabia-amid-houthi-attacks/articleshow/134794137.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-08T20:41:53+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vijaya Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134794265,imgsize-112304.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['BJP's poll campaign has begun': Mann on CBI raids on OSD, 5 others]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bjps-poll-campaign-has-begun-mann-on-cbi-raids-on-osd-5-others/articleshow/134793940.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134793940.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Punjab's Chief Minister Bhagwant Mann has leveled allegations against the BJP, claiming the use of Central investigative agencies for political leverage. He interpreted the recent CBI raids on his office as a signal of an impending election campaign. Mann reiterated his dedication to the interests of Punjab's citizens, dismissing corruption claims and drawing parallels with similar tactics in other states with non-BJP leadership.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bjps-poll-campaign-has-begun-mann-on-cbi-raids-on-osd-5-others/articleshow/134793940.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bjps-poll-campaign-has-begun-mann-on-cbi-raids-on-osd-5-others/articleshow/134793940.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-08T20:30:19+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134794012,imgsize-81823.cms"/></item></channel></rss>